Package: mgcv.taps
Type: Package
Title: TAPS with Generalized Additive Models
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Yihe Yang
Maintainer: Yihe Yang <yxy1234@case.edu>
Description: Implements tests for arbitrary parametric structure (TAPS) in
    generalized additive models. Target functions are decomposed into a
    candidate parametric basis and a spline basis constructed to be
    adaptively orthogonal to it. The package also provides scalable additive
    mixed-model fitting for shared subject-level random-effect structures.
